    "description": "Revision 10 (owner decision 2026-11-04): paymentMethods is NOT checked. Assumes the wallet's config is set and valid, the device can pay and is not compromised, and the app runs on the wallet's own platform (§17.3). googlePayConfig holds the PayriffGooglePayConfig gateway fields of the case.",
